lity (RCF). Bond notes and other borrowings held in prior year were"},{"box":[0.0718,0.7061,0.3738,0.7187],"confidence":1,"text":"fully repaid in conjunction with the refinance."},{"box":[0.0719,0.7354,0.924,0.75],"confidence":1,"text":"The bonds comprise of £390.0m Senior Loan Notes due November 2029 at an interest rate of 9.375% per annum. The Group has"},{"box":[0.0698,0.7499,0.9241,0.766],"confidence":1,"text":"an £80.Om super senior secured RCF which may be increased on an uncommitted basis to £90.Om at the option of the Group,"},{"box":[0.0739,0.7674,0.2669,0.7776],"confidence":1,"text":"maturing in November 2029."},{"box":[0.0698,0.7892,0.924,0.8038],"confidence":1,"text":"Other borrowings include amounts drawn on the Group's RCF facility and was undrawn at the year end (2024: fnil). The principal"},{"box":[0.0719,0.8067,0.3573,0.817],"confidence":1,"text":"subsidiaries are guarantors to the facilities."},{"box":[0.0698,0.8358,0.922,0.849],"confidence":1,"text":"The Company or its affiliates may from time to time seek to retire or purchase the Company's outstanding debt. Such retirements"},{"box":[0.0698,0.8502,0.924,0.8648],"confidence":1,"text":"or repurchases, if any, may depend on prevailing market conditions, the Company's liquidity requirements, contractual restrictions"},{"box":[0.0719,0.8663,0.193,0.8765],"confidence":1,"text":"and other factors."},{"box":[0.0719,0.8968,0.4949,0.907],"confidence":1,"text":"Finance leases are secured over the assets to which they relate."},{"box":[0.8994,0.9186,0.922,0.9302],"confidence":1,"text":"91"}],"page":91,"width":595}
